% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated with words on every sung note, and the listening link is Sony Music Colombia's official upload of the CBS recording, but it has not been tried with students. A Grade 1 classroom teacher must trial the leader/class/percussion turn-taking and the two silent answer bars at 88-104; a Colombian music educator must review the history and context language, decide whether "Cumbia" may stay in the title, and say which Bermúdez recording best serves the lesson (sources disagree on when the song was first recorded); a second score reader must check the notes, words and cues.
